        <mxCell id="catalog-band-title" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;КАТАЛОГ  /  INSURANCE.CATALOG.V1&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="61" y="151" width="1677" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="policies-band" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#EFF5FF;strokeColor=#EFF5FF;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="366" width="1702" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="policies-band-title" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;ОФОРМЛЕННЫЕ ПОЛИСЫ  /  INSURANCE.POLICIES.V1&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="61" y="366" width="1677" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-0" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="202" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-0-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;API 5 → 10 страховщиков&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Опрос каждые 5 мин со сдвигом. Таймаут и квота на страховщика. Сбой сохраняет последний валидный снимок.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="66" y="215" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-1" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="483" y="202" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-1-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;ins-product-aggregator&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Проверяет полноту, нормализует тарифы. В одной транзакции catalog-db пишет изменения, время опроса и outbox.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="501" y="215" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-2" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="918" y="202" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-2-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Debezium → Kafka&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Changed / Withdrawn: полное состояние тарифа и версия, ключ insurerId:productId:tariffId. Refreshed - факт опроса, не готовность проекций.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="936" y="215" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-3" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="1353" y="202" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-3-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Два независимых читателя&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;core-app и ins-comp-settlement обновляют свои проекции в разных consumer groups.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="1371" y="215" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-edge0" parent="1" edge="1" source="step0-0" target="step0-1" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-edge1" parent="1" edge="1" source="step0-1" target="step0-2" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step0-edge2" parent="1" edge="1" source="step0-2" target="step0-3" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-0" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="417" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-0-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;core-app&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Подтверждает оформление, изменение или отмену полиса. Сохраняет условия расчёта, действовавшие при оформлении.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="66" y="430" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-1" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="483" y="417" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-1-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;core-db + outbox&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Сохраняет бизнес-запись и событие одной транзакцией.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="501" y="430" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-2" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="918" y="417" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-2-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Debezium → Kafka&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;PolicyIssued / Adjusted / Cancelled: полный снимок полиса и условий расчёта, версия. Ключ policyId.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="936" y="430" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-3" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="1353" y="417" width="397" height="137" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-3-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;ins-comp-settlement&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:15px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Ведёт локальный реестр полисов. Проверяет полноту потока и сверяет итоги до отправки месячного пакета.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="1371" y="430" width="361" height="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-edge0" parent="1" edge="1" source="step1-0" target="step1-1" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-edge1" parent="1" edge="1" source="step1-1" target="step1-2" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step1-edge2" parent="1" edge="1" source="step1-2" target="step1-3" style="noEdgeStyle=1;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=9;strokeColor=#5C4EA0;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endSize=10;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="delivery-band" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#EFF5FF;strokeColor=#EFF5FF;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="586" width="1702" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="delivery-band-title" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;ГАРАНТИИ И ВОССТАНОВЛЕНИЕ&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="61" y="586" width="1677" height="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="delivery" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="637" width="551" height="219" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="delivery-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;At-least-once и порядок по ключу&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Три зоны, RF=3, min.insync.replicas=2, acks=all. В сообщении eventId, schemaVersion, ключ и версия сущности.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Потребитель пишет проекцию и inbox одной транзакцией. Offset подтверждает после commit. Повторы и устаревшие версии не меняют результат.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="66" y="650" width="515" height="193" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="replay" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="624" y="637" width="551" height="219" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="replay-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Повторы, карантин и replay&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Временные ошибки повторяются с backoff. Некорректные события идут в карантин с алертом. Ошибка по полису блокирует закрытие его периода.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Каталог пересобирается из compacted-топика. Для полисов старше окна хранения нужен снимок core-app и чтение с согласованной границы.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="642" y="650" width="515" height="193" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="operations" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="1200" y="637" width="550" height="219" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="operations-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Свежесть и восстановление&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Следим за свежестью по страховщику, задержкой CDC, WAL, lag читателей и карантином.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Kafka в трёх зонах основного региона. После восстановления копии БД дочитываем outbox от согласованной границы; дубли устраняет inbox. Сверяем версии и итоги.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="1218" y="650" width="514" height="193" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="migration" parent="1" vertex="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#F6F9FD;strokeColor=#CFDDED;strokeWidth=1.4;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="881" width="1702" height="121" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="migration-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:18px;color:#205F99;line-height:1.24;margin-top:0px;font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Переключение со старых опросов&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;color:#425873;line-height:1.24;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;Создать исходные снимки с позицией CDC. Засеять compacted-топик каталогом до публикации новых версий. Наполнять проекции параллельно старым выборкам и сверить их. После сверки отключить два REST-опроса каталога и суточную выгрузку полисов. Внешние API страховщиков, клиентские вызовы и месячный обмен остаются в своих контурах.&lt;/div&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="66" y="894" width="1666" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="references" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#14283E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;rounded=0;spacing=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kafka.apache.org/40/design/design/&quot; style=&quot;color:#205F99&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka · доставка и репликация&lt;/a&gt;　·　&lt;a href=&quot;https://debezium.io/documentation/reference/stable/transformations/outbox-event-router.html&quot; style=&quot;color:#205F99&quot;&gt;Debezium · Outbox Event Router&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="49" y="1024" width="1702" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>